[00:09.41]Eye-so-box
[00:13.96]Eye-so-box is a practice player for the music you already own. Put your files on your iPhone, pick a song, and work on it.
[00:26.56]PLAY ALONG
[00:28.16]• Slow the song down without changing its pitch, or change the key
[00:33.19]• Loop any section with A-B repeat, and let the speed trainer creep the tempo up as you improve
[00:40.93]• Remove the vocals, or split the song into drums, bass, other, vocals (and guitar and piano) with a machine-learning model that runs on your device. Set the volume of every part
[00:56.96]• Record your voice or instrument along with the song. Your take becomes another part you can balance, add reverb to, and keep with the song
[01:12.04]Eye-so-box is a practice player for the music you already own. Put your files on your iPhone, pick a song, and work on it.
[01:26.48]Eye-so-box does not include or sell any music. You need your own music files.
